      "changes": "Retained every selected resource and exact MIT notice, moving adapted entrypoint examples on demand and adding focused lifecycle guidance. Corrected the synchronous database query shown inside an asynchronous handler, distinguished app/request/iterator resource ownership and actual response filtering, marked fake authentication and incomplete snippets as illustrative, and scoped new frontend/SSE/telemetry/serialization APIs to installed-version support. Preserved selected dependency owners, servers, checkers, ORM, HTTP and async tooling, valid class dependencies, router composition and RootModel contracts instead of requiring migrations. Added generated UI metadata and reversible immutable provenance. Converted the unrelated internal response model to an explicit mapping before public-model validation after a focused offline probe exposed a ResponseValidationError with the installed FastAPI/Pydantic versions."
